# ================================
# Assignment 6: model weights and caches -- NEVER commit these
# ================================
# transformers downloads weights into the Hugging Face cache (outside the repo) by default;
# these patterns also stop a copy saved inside the project from being pushed by accident.
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.h5
*.msgpack
llm-test/models/
llm-test/hf_cache/
.cache/
offload/
